       "headline": "The semiconductor giant reported adjusted earnings per share of $2.65, surpassing analyst expectations of $2.55. Quarterly revenue reached $10.6 billion, slightly beating the $10.58 billion consensus estimate, though it marked a 3% decline compared to $10.98 billion in the same period last year.",
